"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1239
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switches to <link linkend=\"juk-viewmode-tree\">Tree View mode</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1248
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Player</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1252
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Player</guimenu><guimenuitem>Random Play</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1256
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a toggle option which controls the Random Play setting. If Random "
"Play is enabled, then &juk; will randomly select a random song from the "
"current playlist when the currently playing song is over."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1263
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Player</guimenu><guimenuitem>Loop Playlist</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a toggle option which controls the Loop Playlist setting. If Loop "
"Playlist is enabled, then &juk; will start playing from the beginning when "
"it has finished playing every song in the current playlist."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1274
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Player</guimenu><guimenuitem>Play</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command starts playing the currently selected song, or resumes playback "
"of the song if it was paused."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1284
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Player</guimenu><guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1288
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command pauses the currently playing song. Use the Play command to "
"restart playback."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1294
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Player</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stop</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command stops the playback of the currently playing song. You cannot "
"resume playback from its current position after that."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1304
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Player</guimenu><guimenuitem>Previous Track</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1308
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command plays the song that was playing before the currently playing "
"song."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1314
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Player</guimenu><guimenuitem>Next Track</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1318
#, no-c-format
msgid "This command skips to the next song to play in the playlist."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1327
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tagger</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>T</"
"keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Tagger</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command saves any changes to the tags that you are editing. Normally, "
"changes are not saved until you deselect the file you are editing."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1344
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tagger</guimenu><guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command deletes the currently selected files from the Collection List "
"and any playlists containing it, and then deletes the selected file from the "
"disk."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>F</"
"keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Tagger</guimenu><guisubmenu>Guess Tag "
"Information</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>From Filename</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command tries to guess the tags of the selected files by scanning the "
"filename. You can configure the patterns used for guessing by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tag Guesser...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, which opens the <link linkend=\"juk-tag-guesser-"
"configuration\">Tag Guesser Configuration dialog</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1371
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>I</"
"keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Tagger</guimenu><guisubmenu>Guess Tag "
"Information</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>From Internet</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1377
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command tries to guess the tags of the selected files by using the "
"<application>trm</application> provided with <ulink url=\"http://www."
"musicbrainz.org/\">MusicBrainz</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1388
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Toolbars</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Show Main Toolbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command shows or hide the <link linkend=\"main-toolbar\">Main Toolbar</"
"link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1404
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Toolbars</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Show Play Toolbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1409
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command shows or hide the <link linkend=\"play-toolbar\">Play Toolbar</"
"link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1415
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Splash Screen on Startup</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a toggle option. If enabled, &juk; will display an informational "
"screen upon startup as it loads your music collection."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1426
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Dock in System Tray</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1431
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a toggle option. If enabled, &juk; will display an icon in your "
"system tray. You can use the system tray icon to tell if &juk; is playing, "
"and control playback."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1438
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Stay in System Tray on Close</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1443
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a toggle option. If enabled, &juk; will remain running if you close "
"the main window. The Dock in System Tray option must also be enabled. To "
"quit &juk;, use the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> command from the main window, or the "
"<guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem> command from the system tray's context menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1453
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Popup Track Announcement</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1458
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a toggle option. If enabled, &juk; will display an indicator "
"whenever a song starts playing, with information on the artist and title, "
"and with buttons allowing you to quickly switch to a different song. The "
"Dock in System Tray option must also be enabled."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1466
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tag Guesser...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1471
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command brings up the <link linkend=\"juk-tag-guesser-configuration"
"\">Tag Guesser Configuration dialog box</link>, where you can alter the "
"patterns used to guess tag information from filenames."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1478
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>File Renamer...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1483
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command brings up the <link linkend=\"juk-rename-dialog\">File Renamer "
"Configuration dialog box</link>, where you can alter the way &juk; renames "
"files for you."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1489
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1494
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This brings up the standard &kde; dialog box where you can configure "
"keyboard shortcuts for &juk;. Some reasonable defaults are included as well, "
"including Multimedia keys for people who have multimedia keyboards."
msgstr ""

